title: "Waves Lawn Tools"
abstract: >-
  Open-source lawn-watering math for Florida lawns: sprinkler runtime to inches
  per week, and a weekly watering plan that counts measured rain, the forecast
  and the local watering limit. The same code powers the free Lawn Watering
  Calculator from Waves Pest Control.
type: software
authors:
